{"id":"aufbewahrt","lemma":"aufbewahrt","pos":"adj","rank":4397,"glosses":["treasured","preserved"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a7/De-aufbewahrt.ogg/De-aufbewahrt.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wo wird es aufbewahrt?","en":"Where is it kept?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"it"},null]},{"text":"Haben Sie die Quittung aufbewahrt?","en":"Did you keep your receipt?","words":[{"g":"have"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"a receipt"},null]},{"text":"Hast du die Quittung aufbewahrt?","en":"Did you keep your receipt?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"a receipt"},null]},{"text":"Ich weiß nicht, wo Tom seinen Schirm aufbewahrt.","en":"I don't know where Tom keeps his umbrella.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"where"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"umbrella"},null]},{"text":"Die Kronjuwelen werden hinter Schloss und Riegel aufbewahrt.","en":"The royal jewels are kept under lock and key.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"crown jewels"},{"g":"to become"},{"g":"behind, after"},{"g":"to shut","l":"schließen"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"bolt"},null]}]}